    "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015110/extras/973ac77a71905da4364ec82e8d9fd058.poster.avif?t=1722267639\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015110/extras/973ac77a71905da4364ec82e8d9fd058.webm?t=1722267639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015110/extras/973ac77a71905da4364ec82e8d9fd058.mp4?t=1722267639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Backrooms Cats</strong> and Lava is an action-platformer with puzzle elements, where you must help a small inhabitant escape a deep cave being engulfed by lava. Navigate your way to the exit by moving boxes, but remember\u2014the floor is lava! Avoid stepping on it at all costs. Use all your skills to survive this fiery labyrinth and find your way out of this infernal place.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015110/extras/5b025857fb86a884884438f4b000523c.poster.avif?t=1722267639\" width=600 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015110/extras/5b025857fb86a884884438f4b000523c.webm?t=1722267639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015110/extras/5b025857fb86a884884438f4b000523c.mp4?t=1722267639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2></strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Puzzle Mechanics:</h2>Solve challenging puzzles by strategically moving boxes to create safe paths and escape the rising lava.<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intense Platforming Action:</h2>Combine quick reflexes with smart planning to navigate through increasingly difficult levels filled with perilous obstacles.<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engaging Survival Challenge:</h2>Test your survival skills as you avoid the deadly lava floor and find creative solutions to escape each treacherous level.<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmospheric Environment:</h2>Immerse yourself in a tense and fiery cave setting, enhanced by atmospheric graphics and sound effects that intensify the experience.</li></ul>",
